+``--vd-lavc-dovi-fel=<yes|no>`` (mpvNova)
+    Decode Dolby Vision Profile 7 enhancement layers (default: no). When
+    disabled, do not create or automatically pair an enhancement-layer
+    decoder, and remove interleaved enhancement-layer video before base-layer
+    decoding. Keep the base layer and any RPU metadata carried with it.
+    Separate-track sources whose RPU exists only in the enhancement track
+    fall back to their base layer without that metadata.
+
+    Set this before loading the file. Reload the file after changing it;
+    unlike the format filter's enhancement-layer option, this controls the
+    decoding pipeline itself. Other Dolby Vision profiles are unaffected.
+
